    echr:hasSupportingQuote "An expert from the National Forensic Bureau found that the applicant had a trace of a small abrasion in the area of his chin, approximately a month old, possibly caused by a hard object. A small wound, no more than three days old, was observed on the applicant’s shin. The report noted that both injuries were located \"within the applicant’s own reach\"."^^xsd:string .

